data: {"id": "7fde87c6d9084364-thinking-parallel_evidence-1205", "run_id": "7fde87c6d9084364", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "node2 状态为 Ready，排除节点 NotReady/失联导致的 Terminating 卡住。结合已有 Metrics 结果：`kube_pod_deletion_timestamp` 返回 1789098427（即 2026-09-11T03:47:07Z），说明 deletionTimestamp 至今仍存在于 API Server，Pod 确实未被清理。\n\n**本轮已采集事实：**\n\n| 维度 | 证据 |\n|------|------|\n| Kubernetes (YAML) | Pod 仍存在；`deletionTimestamp=2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`；`finalizers=[\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`；`nodeName=node2`；`terminationGracePeriodSeconds=10` |\n| Kubernetes (describe) | 容器 app 已 Terminated (exitCode=137)，Started 03:47:04，Finished 03:47:18；删除已持续约 72 分钟 |\n| N", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789102813296, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

